WEBVTT

00:00:00.299 --> 00:00:02.599
The prompt is review priority stores

00:00:02.599 --> 00:00:04.160
in the West region for frozen

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:05.740
product inventory risk.

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:08.119
Include recent refrigeration exceptions,

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.380
shelf availability, and the next expected

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:12.280
inbound delivery.
